    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "xBLOa",
      "x": 3205,
      "y": 10900,
      "name": "Game shell · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EmI34",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOW A GAME PLAYS",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "YCJ9Q",
          "name": "One scroll · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Same shell, every game",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l6Tkuj",
          "name": "One scroll · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME, the steps and the best score sit in the sky; the question hangs under them; the board is dug into the sand. Each game only swaps the board. No start screen: the tile starts round 1.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z4R9Gp",
          "name": "One screen, no scroll · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One screen, no scroll",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lV6iS",
          "name": "One screen, no scroll · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A game screen is one fixed screen: no page scroll and no paging. The sky band keeps its content's height; the sand takes the rest, and the cards share it, growing and shrinking with the window. Scrolling is only a fallback: when a card would drop below its smallest picture (110 on a phone, 150 on an iPad upright) or the result's dinosaur below 120, the whole screen scrolls up and down, NEXT under the cards. That happens on iPhone SE and mini-height phones and in small Mac or Stage Manager windows, never on the three target devices.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vTpug",
          "name": "Scrolling is digging · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Answering",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Oe2y2",
          "name": "Scrolling is digging · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The chosen pocket gets a ring and a mark: a green ring with ✓ when right; a red ring with ✗ when wrong, and the right one rings green with ✓ too. Marks are a symbol plus colour. Both values appear as chips at the bottom right of each picture. The step turns green or red. NEXT appears in the sand (SEE RESULT after 10).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rbJI6",
          "name": "Four layouts by window shape · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Four layouts by window shape",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JTAGE",
          "name": "Four layouts by window shape · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Landscape, at least 600 tall (iPad 11, iPad mini): cards side by side, VS between. Portrait, at least 600 wide (iPad upright): cards stacked, VS on the seam, NEXT in a row under them. Narrow portrait, under 600 wide (iPhone upright): stacked, the house alone, the level switch as pictures, PLAY AGAIN over HOME. Short landscape, under 600 tall (iPhone on its side): a short bar, NEXT beside the prompt, cards side by side, the result's dinosaur beside the rewards. Inside each layout sizes are fluid; type for prompts and names is the largest that fits the longest one in either language.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NJrKc",
          "name": "iPad 11 and iPad mini · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "iPad 11 and iPad mini",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "e3G1TD",
          "name": "iPad 11 and iPad mini · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Landscape: cards side by side with VS between. iPad 11 uses the same layout with more sky; nothing moves.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KljWk",
          "name": "iPhone · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "iPhone",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ASxVa",
          "name": "iPhone · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME is a 56 px house; the best score moves to the result. Cards stack with VS on the seam. NEXT, PLAY AGAIN and HOME fill the width, 64 tall. The level switch shows pictures only.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "R4Sdux",
          "name": "Nothing sticks · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Tx8TB",
          "name": "Nothing sticks · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The dinosaur stands in the sky over the rewards: score, ten stars, WELL DONE!, then NEW BEST! (or the plain best). Level switch above PLAY AGAIN and HOME. No celebration unless the score beats the best; a first round of 0 gets none.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l5oW0",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "aM2jo",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Cards rise out of the sand; a right mark pops with a star flying to its step; a wrong pocket shakes once. On the result the glow opens, confetti falls once and the stars fill one by one. Reduced motion: short fades only.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MLmEf",
          "name": "Edges · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Taps",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S6iOK",
          "name": "Edges · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A double tap counts once: after the first tap the cards lock until NEXT.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
